# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets & credentials — CODING_GUIDELINES.md §12 [MANDATORY]
# Real credentials live in AWS Secrets Manager / the BYOK key vault.
# Nothing secret-bearing may ever reach this repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# The staging template documents the SHAPE of deploy/staging/.env and holds no
# real values -- same role as .env.example, so the same exemption. The filled-in
# copy beside it (deploy/staging/.env) stays ignored by the `.env` rule above.
!.env.staging.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
secrets.json
credentials.json
# Kubernetes Secret manifests carry the same credentials in a different
# envelope -- base64 in a Secret is encoding, not encryption. The templates
# beside them (*.example.yaml) document the shape and hold no real values.
deploy/k8s/*secret*.yaml
deploy/k8s/*secret*.yml
!deploy/k8s/*.example.yaml
.aws/

# Recorded LLM fixtures / query captures containing real school data
# (CODING_GUIDELINES.md §17). Redacted fixtures belong in fixtures/.
**/fixtures/**/*.real.json
**/__recordings__/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dependencies
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.turbo/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tests, coverage, load-test output (docs/09 gates)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.lcov
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/

# Benchmark output from apps/mcp-server/scripts/bench-fee-index.ts (AUDIT_REPORT
# C21). Timings and query plans only -- no school rows -- but they are one
# machine's reading on one day, not a fact about the product.
bench-fee-index.*.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime artifacts — generated reports may contain school PII
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
tmp/
.cache/
generated-pdfs/
exports/
dump.rdb
*.local.sqlite

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Logs
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Infrastructure as code — /ops/
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed (pins provider versions).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editor & OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Claude Code — CLAUDE.md is committed; local overrides are not
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Other AI coding tools — CLAUDE.md is the only committed
# orientation doc. Codex regenerates AGENTS.md as a stale copy
# of it; do not commit the duplicate.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AGENTS.md
.codex/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# School data — real PII. Never committed.
# CODING_GUIDELINES.md §21: "never commit ... recorded LLM fixtures
# containing real school data". The local ai_analysis dump carries
# student names, enrollment numbers and fee records.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.dump
*.mysql
data/
dumps/

# ...but SQL that is SOURCE CODE is tracked. The blanket rule above targets
# DATA (dumps, extracts, exports); these directories hold schema and
# configuration, which must be in the repo or a fresh clone cannot build.
#
# [MANDATORY] Anything under these paths must contain schema, topology or
# configuration ONLY -- never row-level school data. A seed file that grows
# student rows belongs in data/ and stays untracked (CODING_GUIDELINES §21).
!**/migrations/*.sql
!**/schema/*.sql
!**/seed/*.sql
!**/queries/*.sql

# Stub ERP dev signing keys (generated, never committed)
tools/erp-stub/.keys/
